cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its gold sets, please cite it as below."
title: "AnalogNetlistLabel: Evidence-Backed Semantic Annotation for Unknown Analog SPICE Netlists"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic, port-first semantic annotation layer for unfamiliar flat
  analog SPICE netlists. It recovers device roles, match groups, net classes,
  structural roles, blocks, evidence, confidence, and a human review queue
  without modifying the source netlist. It also ships a selective-prediction
  evaluation protocol and small human-reviewed gold sets.
